<Weblab2>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "published": true,
  "game_id": 74,
  "created_at": "2026-05-10T06:55:14.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 18603,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Build the Ad Algorithm\r\n\r\n## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. In `script.js`, complete `runAdPipeline()` so it builds a custom ad feed from `adDatabase`.\r\n\r\n   ::: details [Ideas for customizing your ad feed]\r\n\r\n   - You might filter ads by the user's age, match ads to interests, remove low-quality ads, or sort by bid or quality.\r\n   :::\r\n\r\n2. Your function should filter the ads, sort the ads that remain, update `displayAds`, and call `renderFeed()`.\r\n\r\n3. Test your ad algorithm by clicking **Run Ad Algorithm**. Check that the app shows the ads you want, hides the ads you do not want, and appears in the order you chose.\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "engineer",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
